                    <strong>⚠️ Key Context:</strong> BC originally requested <strong
                        >9,000 nominations</strong
                    > for 2026 to meet its labor market needs. The initial 5,254 was
                    58% of that request; even after the August increase, 6,254 is about
                    69% of it.
                </div>

