              <p><strong>Case B (hypothetical):</strong> Ravi, 28, hospitality supervisor. The Entry Level and Semi-Skilled stream is closed, and food service supervisors are now ineligible for every stream. Long-haul trucking is not on the Care or Build lists either, so his realistic options are improving his profile for Innovate or looking at other provinces and federal programs.</p>
